<title>ITALY: Benetton inaugurates megastore in Romania.</title>
<headline>Benetton inaugurates megastore in Romania.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian clothing group Benetton on Monday opened its first megastore in Romania in one of the main shopping streets in the centre of Bucharest.</p>
<p>The group, present in Romania since 1992 when it opened a shop in Brasov, said in a statement that it now has nearly 200 shops in east European countries.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
